<rml><head><title>Replay graphical timeline</title><link type="text/template" href="../../components/dialog.rml"/><link type="text/rcss" href="theatre.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="timeline.rcss"/></head>
<body template="prime-dialog"><div id="replay_timeline_panel" class="prime_dialog"><h2>REPLAY TIMELINE</h2><p id="replay_timeline_window"/><div class="timeline_actions">
<button id="replay_timeline_refresh" data-action="replay:timeline-refresh">REFRESH REVIEW</button>
<button id="replay_timeline_zoom_in" data-action="replay:timeline-zoom-in">ZOOM IN</button>
<button id="replay_timeline_zoom_out" data-action="replay:timeline-zoom-out">ZOOM OUT</button>
<button id="replay_timeline_earlier" data-action="replay:timeline-pan-left">EARLIER</button>
<button id="replay_timeline_later" data-action="replay:timeline-pan-right">LATER</button>
<button id="replay_timeline_center" data-action="replay:timeline-center">CENTER PLAYHEAD</button>
<button id="replay_timeline_reset" data-action="replay:timeline-reset">FULL RECORDING</button>
</div><p>Activate a camera marker to focus its saved key. Toggle or range selects keys. Drag a key to preview moving the selected group, then review the complete change before saving.</p>
